@startuml part-block-header
' ============================================================================
' part-block-header.puml — the 64-byte on-disk Block Header (persistent ART).
' Source: docs/theory/disk-tries/04-persistent-art.md, § Block Layout.
' Drawn as a CONTIGUOUS colored field table (field:type + description columns)
' hosted in a floating note; rows share borders (no gaps). Full-cell color via
' Creole |<#hex>| cells. NOTE: the source gives no authoritative byte offsets
' (field sizes sum to 60, not the titled 64) — so no offset column is fabricated.
' Color key:  green  #C8E6C9  identity (magic, version, block_type, block_id)
'             amber  #FFE0B2  flags / counters (flags, num_entries, free_offset)
'             purple #E1BEE7  integrity (64-bit checksum)
'             blue   #BBDEFB  block-chain links (prev / next)
'             grey   #ECEFF1  reserved padding
' ============================================================================
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam TitleFontSize 15
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #37474F
}

title Block Header — 64 bytes

note as BH
|= field |= description |
|<#C8E6C9> magic : u32 |<#C8E6C9> identifies a valid block |
|<#C8E6C9> version : u16 |<#C8E6C9> format version |
|<#C8E6C9> block_type : u8 |<#C8E6C9> 0 = nodes · 1 = buckets · 2 = metadata |
|<#FFE0B2> flags : u8 |<#FFE0B2> compression, etc. |
|<#C8E6C9> block_id : u32 |<#C8E6C9> this block's ID |
|<#E1BEE7> checksum : u64 |<#E1BEE7> 64-bit hash of contents |
|<#FFE0B2> num_entries : u16 |<#FFE0B2> number of nodes / entries |
|<#FFE0B2> free_offset : u16 |<#FFE0B2> start of free space |
|<#BBDEFB> prev_block : u32 |<#BBDEFB> previous block in chain (or 0) |
|<#BBDEFB> next_block : u32 |<#BBDEFB> next block in chain (or 0) |
|<#ECEFF1> padding : [u8; 28] |<#ECEFF1> reserved for future use |
end note

legend bottom
| Color | Field |
|<#C8E6C9>| identity — magic · version · block_type · block_id |
|<#FFE0B2>| flags / counters |
|<#E1BEE7>| 64-bit integrity checksum |
|<#BBDEFB>| block-chain links |
|<#ECEFF1>| reserved padding |
endlegend
@enduml
